        "content": "## PainPal · R4 · POST /prescription\nSaves the patient's as-needed medication: drug, dose mg, min hours between doses, 24 h max, pain goal. Validated here (400 with a message); B4/B6 then use these limits as hard rules.\nIn real use the prescriber would set these.\n\n**Owner:** Person B · built by n8n/build.js · **Activate** to use `/webhook/prescription`.",
